The Godhome is the realm beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]], home to the Outer Gods and the place the dead of [[Færrin]] pass on to. It shows in the day sky of Færrin as twin suns. The only way there is the [[Pharos]], and anyone who makes the trek into the Godhome and returns is a [[Hierophant|hierophant]].
